OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F358A1785259144
OL,3,CFive people taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ctwo car collision in Guernsey
OL,6,FFive people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after two cars collided near
OL,8,FL'Islet in Guernsey on Friday 24 July.
OL,10,FMultiple emergency services responded
OL,11,Fshortly after 5pm, including four
OL,12,Fdouble crewed ambulances, the police,
OL,13,Ffire service and Civil Protection
OL,14,Fvolunteers.
OL,16,FBoth off-duty staff and nightshift
OL,17,Fcrews were called in to cover, as well
OL,18,Fas Volunteer Community First
OL,19,FResponders, who assisted with an
OL,20,Funrelated medical incident elsewhere.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/3
