OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F358A1785259144
OL,3,CFive people taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ctwo car collision in Guernsey
OL,6,FChief Operating Officer Aimee Lihou
OL,7,Fsaid: " Incidents requiring multiple
OL,8,Fambulance resources are relatively
OL,9,Frare, however when they do happen, or
OL,10,Fwhen demand increases, we have plans
OL,11,Fin place to ensure the appropriate
OL,12,Fresponses are activated."
OL,14,F"Our Operational Commanders are
OL,15,Ftrained to assess and prioritise
OL,16,Fresources at the scene accordingly,
OL,17,Flikewise 999 calls are triaged by the
OL,18,FJoint Emergency Services Control
OL,19,FCentre to ensure an appropriate and
OL,20,Ftimely response for medical cases
OL,21,Felsewhere in the island."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/3
