OL,3,CFive people taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ctwo car collision in Guernsey
OL,6,FGuernsey Police have confirmed that
OL,7,Fthe collision resulted in a range of
OL,8,Finjuries, however none were life
OL,9,Fthreatening.
